Z||000045||EdsB52||10-29-2001||04:59 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Kasdan:<BR><B>What is with you people?  Let me make one thing clear.  I asked her permission, and told her my reasonsings for it.  Hell, i even told you me reasionings for it.  TO BOOST HER SELF ESTEEM.  Corinne, her name is Shelly, and if you have a problem with people posting personal pictures on here, DONT DO IT YOURSELF.  Every post i make, you people tear into and analize.  I didnt ask for you people to do that, i asked for a simple opinion of my girlfriend.  I hope you people piss your pants when i pull up to your door and let you drive a fiero with power steering (for you people who believed me on that, thank you.)  You act like im some horrible person or something.  You laugh at me because im different, i laugh because your all the same.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>"Hell, i even told you me reasionings for it."<P>Are you a pirate?<P>"TO BOOST HER SELF ESTEEM."<P>Oh yea, that's a real esteem-builder; imagining guys two to three times her age pounding off to her likeness. Hey, maybe if she strips or sells her body for money she'll become even more secure and feel more self-worth. And to think, you're enabling her, what a guy.<P>"You act like im some horrible person or something."<P>And exactly who needs the esteem building?<P>"I hope you people piss your pants when i pull up to your door and let you drive a fiero with power steering (for you people who believed me on that, thank you.)"<P>Why, do you like piss-soiled seats? If you want, you can drive up and I'll piss directly into your seat, that way you'll cut out the middleman.<P>Hey man, we’re just having fun. Was it tacky to post your girlfriends pics? Yes, and it reveals an insecurity on your part, as you want the world to see that you have a pretty girlfriend. Does your Fiero have P/S? I don't know, I don't care, but it sounds like a screwy idea because a Fiero needs many things, but P/S is not one of those. I wasn't involved in the whole P/S issue, but if you say you have P/S in your Fiero, I'll believe you. I just wish someone would install A/C that doesn't break every year into a Fiero.<P>"You laugh at me because im different, i laugh because your all the same."<P>Pretty bold statement from a kid. I agree with individuality, but different on your scale is probably much less diverse than different on the scales of many of the members in this forum. There are many members in this forum with all kinds of life experiences and education, whereas different to you might be that you like licorice ice cream instead of chocolate or vanilla. Some guys in this forum have been to war, shot people, been shot, or had friends die. Some members have PhD's or own very successful businesses. A whole myriad of diversity and differences exist in this club, but you insist you're the different one at 19 years of age (or whatever you are)? Please, don't insult the life experiences, education, and accomplishments of some very dynamic people with your "You laugh at me because im different, i laugh because your all the same" rhetoric. Did you read that somewhere and decide to plagiarize when the opportunity arose?||||reg||1
